      "message": "fix(vise): refuse parallels under a grip-jaw vise; place-mode origin text\n\nParallels fit from the vise floor, but a grip vise's frame z = 0 is its\nledge: the fit stood the stock clear of the jaws with no message. The\nunder-stock fit now refuses a vise with a grip step by name. The place\nmode doc and MCP description name the ledge as the origin with a step;\nthe decision note records the 0 defaults and the width reference.\n\nRefs #1274\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
